  "reviewed_findings": [
    "All eleven exact profile labels carry identical GNU APL 2.0 runtime metadata; recorded interpreter SHA, binary SHA and runtime SHA agree with the original audited profiles and inherited pin set.",
    "The saved ARM64 Darwin build tag and configuration identify the local interpreter. The config.h configure arguments agree with the recorded -O3 -DNDEBUG -std=c++11, PCRE2 paths and disabled X/GTK/database options; no fast-math option is recorded.",
